<<PlayBackgroundMusic Exciting_1>>
<<SetBGSprite KohliwadaGround>>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Captain. We did it. You did it. You are a star. Maa's medicines, Baba's knee towel, new soles for your shoes. A small step into the void of greatness.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I tried my best.

<<SetCharacterExpression "CoachDev" "Smiling">>
CoachDev: Humble and grounded. That's my boy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: I am deeply obliged that you came to watch me play sir.

<<SetCharacterExpression "CoachDev" "Smiling">>
CoachDev: I wouldn't have missed it for the world.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: The real test is in 24 hours sir. 90% or his dream evaporates into thin air.

<<SetCharacterExpression "CoachDev" "Smiling">>
CoachDev: Let him enjoy today. Let him relax.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: No sir. I got to rush him to study. Time is vital. Need to prepare for my weak spots.

<<SetCharacterExpression "CoachDev" "Smiling">>
CoachDev: That's my boy. Never misses a beat.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: He has been trained well.

<<SetCharacterExpression "CoachDev" "Smiling">>
CoachDev: Of course. This is all you Ramu. Raju is lucky to have a mentor like you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Yes sir. I am lucky beyond words to have bhaiyya in my life.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: All right captain. Stop making me emotional. We head home and dig into the books.

